{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055562540449915","content":"Leaf runs up to the door and quickly stuffs a letter addressed to <@436232470242000916> underneath and runs back to Town Square. The handwriting is in quick, curly cursive.\n\n||```Percival,\nOk... A lot has happened. First off, hear me out. It wasn't Rock that stole Mello. The Golden Dawn is familiar with Ebuc's work, and they're manipulating him somehow. It's not his fault. Don't you dare be unkind to him because of this. I need your help to figure out how this is happening. I won't let this be like things were on the sub. Things can't end like they did for our four friends.\n\nSecondly, Rockman is a paladin to Mello now. Not only is this why there is no doubt in my mind that Rock is still himself, but it also made Mello stronger. I could feel it. I know you want to protect her too, and all of us. I know that feeling. I won't force you to do anything that isn't you, but Mello has helped me help others. I know you're trying to create a new life for yourself, so maybe consider this as well? All I know is, you want to help others, and that's what Mello helps me do. She is the best of this world, and deserves more people like you following her.\n\nI'd be happy to talk it over with you, but for the time being, I need to do my best to stay with Rockman.\n\nBest wishes,\n~Leaf```||","created_at":"2020-08-14T21:53:50.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743950537837248605","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
